---
description: Fastify API conventions
globs: "apps/api/**"
---

- Fastify + Zod for request/response validation.
- `POST /api/agents/:id/run` returns `{ runId }` immediately; execution is in-process.
- Cancel via `AgentRuntime.cancel()` — never call Strands directly from routes.
- Write events to Postgres before sending on SSE stream.
